/images/9781250428325.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;test&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;span&gt;The multiple award-winning performer and producer shares insights into how she overcame obstacles to complete real and metaphorical marathons.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;br&gt;New this week&lt;br&gt;Author: by Cynthia Erivo&lt;br&gt;Publisher: Flatiron</description><link>https://www.amazon.com/dp/1250428327?tag=thenewyorktim-20</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.amazon.com/dp/1250428327?tag=thenewyorktim-20</guid><author>by Cynthia Erivo</author></item><item><title>9: THE ANXIOUS GENERATION</title><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://static01.nyt.com/bestsellers/images/9780593655030.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;test&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;span&gt;A co-author of “The Coddling of the American Mind” looks at the mental health impacts that a phone-based life has on children.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;br&gt;83 weeks on the list&lt;br&gt;Author: by Jonathan Haidt&lt;br&gt;Publisher: Penguin Press</description><link>https://www.amazon.com/dp/0593655036?tag=thenewyorktim-20</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.amazon.com/dp/0593655036?tag=thenewyorktim-20</guid><author>by Jonathan Haidt</author></item><item><title>10: 100 RULES FOR LIVING TO 100</title><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://static01.nyt.com/bestsellers/images/9781538777909.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;test&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;span&gt;The multiple award-winning entertainer reflects upon how his positivity shaped his life and career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;br&gt;New this week&lt;br&gt;Author: by Dick Van Dyke with Tal McThenia&lt;br&gt;Publisher: Grand Central</description><link>https://www.amazon.com/dp/1538777908?tag=thenewyorktim-20</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.amazon.com/d